### PNG scan -> image + OCR
POST {{host}}/api/documents/analyze?dispatch=false
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=sample

--sample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="scan-ocr.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./images/scan-ocr.png
--sample--

### Excel -> markdown table
POST {{host}}/api/documents/analyze?dispatch=false
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=sample

--sample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="orders.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./office/orders.xlsx
--sample--

### Word -> markdown
POST {{host}}/api/documents/analyze?dispatch=false
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=sample

--sample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="report.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< ./office/report.docx
--sample--

### Override: render a text PDF to PNG
POST {{host}}/api/documents/analyze?dispatch=false&strategy=RenderToPng
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=sample

--sample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="text.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./pdf/text.pdf
--sample--

### Override: original bytes as-is
POST {{host}}/api/documents/analyze?dispatch=false&strategy=AsIs
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=sample

--sample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="report.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< ./office/report.docx
--sample--

### Rejected (400): Markdown does not apply to images
POST {{host}}/api/documents/analyze?dispatch=false&strategy=Markdown
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=sample

--sample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="scan-ocr.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./images/scan-ocr.png
--sample--

### Signed PDF: see classification.signatures
POST {{host}}/api/documents/analyze?dispatch=false
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=sample

--sample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="signed.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./pdf/signed.pdf
--sample--

### Metadata and text only (includeData=false): no base64 page images
POST {{host}}/api/documents/analyze?dispatch=false&includeData=false
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=sample

--sample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="fax-ocr.tif"
Content-Type: image/tiff

< ./images/fax-ocr.tif
--sample--

### Rejected (415): plain text, whatever it is called
POST {{host}}/api/documents/analyze?dispatch=false
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=sample

--sample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="notes.txt"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./unsupported/notes.txt
--sample--

### Rejected (415): legacy / password-protected Office
POST {{host}}/api/documents/analyze?dispatch=false
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=sample

--sample
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="legacy.doc"
Content-Type: application/msword

< ./unsupported/legacy.doc
--sample--
